     "planLine": "wide — Levin, Julian, Max, Kiaan — the four kick a ball between the Wasserkirche and the Grossmünster on a foggy autumn afternoon — the four children and the foggy Zurich setting are established",
     "pageNumber": 1
    },
    {
     "planLine": "close-up — Levin, Julian — Julian holds up a large warm scale he has just found against the old stone wall of the Grossmünster — the warm scale exists and is now in the children's hands",
     "pageNumber": 2
    },
    {
     "planLine": "wide — Kiaan, Levin — Kiaan lifts the scale off the wall and a misty path opens in the stone behind it — the path into the dragon world stands open",
     "pageNumber": 3
    },
    {
     "planLine": "close-up — Max, Levin — Max cups his hands around his mouth and shouts into the misty silence of the open path — someone in the mist now knows the children are there",
     "pageNumber": 4
    },
    {
     "planLine": "close-up — Sura — Sura's great grey head leans out of the mist, eyes heavy, as her deep tired voice answers the call — Sura has spoken: she will rise into the clouds alone with the big evening wind",
     "pageNumber": 5
    },
    {
     "planLine": "wide — Levin, Julian, Max, Kiaan — the four walk in a line onto the misty path through the gap in the Grossmünster wall, seen from behind — the children have left the ordinary world and entered the dragon's world",
     "pageNumber": 6
    },
    {
     "planLine": "low-angle — Levin, Julian — Julian stumbles over stones in the thick low-hanging mist while Levin steadies him from in front — the fog has swallowed the path and the group cannot see where to go",
     "pageNumber": 7
    },
    {
     "planLine": "close-up — Kiaan — Kiaan holds the scale out in both hands and turns toward the direction where it grows warmest, his face intent on the warmth in his palms — the scale's warmth gives the group a way through the fog",
     "pageNumber": 8
    },
    {
     "planLine": "ultra-wide — Sura — Sura beats her great grey wings and launches off a rocky ledge toward the highest peak far above while the wind rises around her — Sura has flown to the highest peak and the wind is growing stronger",
     "pageNumber": 9
    },
    {
     "planLine": "high-angle — Levin, Kiaan, Max — on a slope of sliding loose stones Kiaan grips the scale tight while Max seizes his jacket and Levin hauls them both upward — the children have reached the top of the loose-stone slope",
     "pageNumber": 10
    },
    {
     "planLine": "wide — Levin, Julian, Max, Kiaan — the four stand at the summit before Sura's great wing stretched across the path like a wall, seen from behind as they face it — the way to Sura is barred and all four are stopped",
     "pageNumber": 11
    },
    {
     "planLine": "close-up — Max, Sura — Max tips his head back and shouts Sura's name at the turned-away dragon looming above him — Sura does not turn and the wind is now almost strong enough to lift her",
     "pageNumber": 12
    },
    {
     "planLine": "low-angle — Levin, Sura — Levin's foot slips on the last high rock above the wing but his hands clench tight on the stone and he calls Sura's name up into the autumn wind — Levin is alone on the high rock calling out loud",
     "pageNumber": 13
    },
    {
     "planLine": "close-up — Sura — Sura's great head turns slowly toward the small boy on the rock, her eye wide with fear for him, and her chest swings around to face the children — Sura's chest is now turned toward the children for the first time",
     "pageNumber": 14
    },
    {
     "planLine": "close-up — Julian, Levin — Julian points at the dark gap in Sura's chest where a tiny flame flickers, and Levin, level with it, stares at the scale in his hands — the gap and the scale belong together: Levin knows what to do",
     "pageNumber": 15
    },
    {
     "planLine": "close-up — Levin, Sura — Levin presses the scale firmly into the gap in Sura's chest and the flame behind it swells from a flicker into a strong warm glow — the gap is closed, the wind is blocked, and Sura's fire burns big and warm again",
     "pageNumber": 16
    },
    {
     "planLine": "wide — Sura, Levin, Julian, Max, Kiaan — Sura leads the four children back through the fog, all moving together toward the faint glow of the doorway in the old wall ahead — Sura stays and guides the children safely back through the fog",
